     "body_text": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "Design tokens define visual property values for consistent use across channels and platforms. They underpin the Aalto design system, providing a universal source of truth for design, ensuring cohesion, and promoting effective collaboration between designers and developers. This streamlines the design and development process, reducing errors, simplifying design management, and enhancing the overall product quality.",
